{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014C3vBx93mpWDHQzfFfrAEm","type":"tool_result","content":"# Training corpora (unique tokens after dedup)\n\n| domain | unique tokens | notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| web    | 3.0e+12 | filtered CommonCrawl-style web text; effectively inexhaustible at our scale |\n| code   | 1.6e+10 | permissively licensed source code, deduplicated at file level |\n| math   | 2.1e+10 | math web pages, textbooks and worked solutions |\n| papers | 5.0e+10 | scientific papers (full text) |\n\nEval sets (held out, never trained on): `general` (broad web/knowledge text), `code` (code completion),\n`math` (math problems with solutions).  The team's headline number is the composite\n`0.095 * general + 0.285 * code + 0.62 * math`.\n\nThe target run: 2.5B non-embedding parameters, 500B training tokens, single run, standard recipe\n(the proxies use the same recipe at smaller size).\n---\n{\n \"ops\": {\n  \"train\": {\n   \"args\": {\n    \"N\": \"non-embedding parameters, 5e+07..4e+08\",\n    \"D\": \"training tokens, 1e+09..2e+10\",\n    \"mix\": \"sampling weights over ['web', 'code', 'math', 'papers'] (sum to 1)\",\n    \"pool\": \"optional {domain: unique tokens}: restrict the unique data a run may draw from (default: the full corpus for every domain); tokens beyond the pool are repeats\"\n   },\n   \"cost\": \"6*N*D FLOPs\",\n   \"returns\": \"eval_loss per eval set (['general', 'code', 'math']), composite (weighted by {'general': 0.095, 'code': 0.285, 'math': 0.62}), tokens_seen / unique_tokens_available / epochs per domain\"\n  }\n },\n \"corpus_unique_tokens\": {\n  \"web\": 3000000000000.0,\n  \"code\": 15625823631.892616,\n  \"math\": 20747911539.64751,\n  \"papers\": 50433006481.05815\n },\n \"target\": {\n  \"N\": 2500000000.0,\n  \"D\": 500000000000.0\n },\n \"deliverable\": \"/app/mixture.json\",\n \"budget_total\": 5e+19,\n \"budget_left\": 5e+19\n}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3